==Esperanto==
===Etymology===
English [[joy]], French [[joie]], Italian [[gioia]]

===Verb===
{{eo-verb|ĝoj}}
# to be [[glad]], [[happy]], or [[joyful]]; to [[rejoice]]
#: Kiam la militio finis, oni strate '''ĝojis'''.
#: ''When the war ended, people rejoiced in the streets.''
#: Mi ne sciias kial vi '''ĝojas.'''
#: ''I don't know why you are happy.''

===Derived terms===
* [[ĝoja]], ''glad'', ''joyful''
* [[ĝoja]], ''happiness'', ''joy''

